# What running the tests needs, on top of what running the service needs.
#
# `jfast new module` prints `pytest modules/<name>/tests` as its next step, and
# requirements.txt has no pytest in it -- it is the list this service deploys
# with, and a test runner does not belong in a production image. So the step it
# printed answered `No module named pytest` on a fresh project.
-r requirements.txt
jfastframework[dev]{{ framework_pin }}
